{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"942","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"水情吃緊… 三大科學園區 節水應戰","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">04:09&nbsp; 2020/10/15 工商時報 彭媁琳、馮建棨</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><img alt=\\\"背景圖片圖／本報資料照\\\" src=\\\"https://images.chinatimes.com/newsphoto/2020-10-15/900/A01A00_P_04_01.jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 80%;\\\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">背景圖片圖/本報資料照</span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-top: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\\\" />\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">國內水情吃緊，科技部長吳政忠14日在立法院答詢時表示，三大科學園區會請廠商節約用水，各園區都有相當的儲水設備，各園區約有二到五天的備水量，行政院也會調度資源支援工業用水。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">水情吃緊，經濟部14日召開水情會議，決定桃竹苗中四縣市即日起水情燈號調整為夜間減壓供水的黃燈，並希望產業自主節水5％，另外也盤點全台147座抗旱水井，供後續產業儲水用。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">立法院14日審查科技部及所屬單位110年度預算時，朝野立委關切科學園區用水問題，吳政忠指出，科學園區的用水是重要議題，上周行政院長蘇貞昌已指示各部會針對水情預做準備，強調行政院會調配資源，支援科學園區用水。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">吳政忠說，會先請科學園區的廠商節約用水，萬一到最後情形，各科學園區都有相當的儲水設備，蓄水池都有二到五天的備水量。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">竹科管理局局長王永壯表示，竹科隨時配合經濟部關注水情發展，也跟自來水公司、氣象局密切配合，減壓供水暫時不會對竹科廠商造成影響，廠商已採取備水措施。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">王永壯會後受訪時指出，竹科平時就有節約用水的獎勵，現在也會輔導廠商節約用水，目前製程用水再利用比率可達80％，園區都有不同的蓄水池容量，但基本上不太可能會到那個情形。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">經濟部14日召開抗旱會議，由於氣象局預估未來雨量正常偏少，因此成立中央旱災應變中心，每周召開會議滾動檢討水情。由於今年是有史以來豐水期降雨最少的一年，水利署提前在7月就已開始水源調度，為確保水源穩定，周三起四縣市水情燈號變為黃燈，以利後續相關抗旱措施推動。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">值得注意得是，目前全台有147口抗旱水井，另外還有台糖、水利會、地方政府所屬有77口抗旱水井，水利署說，經過檢查之後水質達標就可以開放供水，以新竹地區有17口水井，後續會公布地點，預估每日可增加供水3萬噸。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">資料來源：https://www.chinatimes.com/newspapers/20201015000159-260202?chdtv</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-10-20","clk_count":"105"}},"__N_SSG":true}